                    memorandum was a copy of the memorandum of January 8 (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg217">p. 217</ref>) with indicated revisions in
                    the text and with the addition of the attached “draft minute.” Since these
                    amendments to the original memorandum were made at the meeting of the Chiefs of
                    Staff on January 13, 1942, the editors have supplied this date on the revised
                    version.</p>
            </note>
